# What NOT to publish to the website.
#
# Vercel serves every file it receives, so without this list the scraper,
# the project notes and the Mac helper scripts would all be fetchable as web
# pages. None of them hold secrets — they are already public on GitHub — but
# the website only needs the page, its numbers and the logo.
#
# The site itself is: index.html, privacy.html, data/, somba-logo.jpg

# The scraper and its tests
*.py
__pycache__/

# Mac-side helpers — meaningless on a web server
*.command
*.plist
scripts/

# Notes and docs
*.md
.github/

# Local-only files that are not part of the dashboard
roles.html
logs/
.playwright-mcp/
